title: "EMG Gesture Classifier: Hardware Constraints and Cross-Session Degradation"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, ATmega328P firmware and verification scripts for a paired
  ablation of channel count, sample rate and quantization in surface EMG
  gesture classification across 28 days, using the open GRABMyo dataset.
